  "display_title": "The Contractors of Pandora",
  "description": "Pandora is a bustling new planet where fiction merges with reality… and it’s on the brink of destruction! People everywhere signed contracts that unwittingly bind their souls with demons, causing mysterious calamities to ravage Pandora. Hector is a detective who brings misfortune wherever he goes, while Eustino is a vampire and priest on a quest. Together, they take it upon themselves to prevent the looming apocalypse. With each contract broken and power gained, will they defeat a nefarious cult’s doomsday scheme and help Pandora break free?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
